\textbf{Marking policy.} Question and criterion totals are fixed by the brief. Task totals match the student exam; detailed partial-credit breakdowns below are proposed. Award stated fractions for demonstrated components, including valid alternative methods. Allow consistent follow-through after one arithmetic error when subsequent reasoning is correct; do not award a missing normalization or independent verification merely because a table looks plausible. Cap each task, question and criterion at its allocation.


