\Needspace{5\baselineskip}\textbf{PMF checks.}
\begin{itemize}
\item Nonnegativity: every listed mass is strictly positive.
\item Normalization: $\GTenHLProbability{4}+\GTenHLProbability{18}+\GTenHLProbability{12}+\GTenHLProbability{12}+\GTenHLProbability{1}+\GTenHLProbability{28}+\GTenHLProbability{9}=\GTenHLProbability{84}$, so the masses sum to $\GTenHLProbability{84/84}=\GTenHLProbability{1}$.
\item Outside the \GTenHLValue{support}: set $\GTenHLProbability{p_X(x)}=\GTenHLProbability{0}$ there. The graph places bars at the actual monetary values; gaps carry no mass.
