\subsection*{Task 2 --- question and worked solution (proposed allocation) \score{3}}
\label{sol:q6t2}

\noindent\textbf{\boldmath Construct the complete CDF table, including both tails, and draw a labeled step graph. Use open and filled endpoints correctly and preserve actual monetary spacing.}\par\nopagebreak

For $\HLCumulativeProbability{F_X(x)}=P(\GTenHLValue{X}\leq \GTenHLValue{x})$, add masses in increasing payout order. The successive cumulative numerators are $\HLCumulativeProbability{4},\allowbreak\HLCumulativeProbability{22},\allowbreak\HLCumulativeProbability{34},\allowbreak\HLCumulativeProbability{46},\allowbreak\HLCumulativeProbability{47},\allowbreak\HLCumulativeProbability{75},\allowbreak\HLCumulativeProbability{84}$, all over $\HLCumulativeProbability{84}$.

\begin{center}
\begin{tabular}{cc}\toprule
Cutoff interval (\GTenHLValue{USD}) & $\HLCumulativeProbability{F_X(x)}$\\\midrule
$\GTenHLValue{x}<\GTenHLValue{0}$ & $\HLCumulativeProbability{0}$\\
$\GTenHLValue{0}\leq \GTenHLValue{x}<\GTenHLValue{6}$ & $\HLCumulativeProbability{1/21}$\\
$\GTenHLValue{6}\leq \GTenHLValue{x}<\GTenHLValue{12}$ & $\HLCumulativeProbability{11/42}$\\
$\GTenHLValue{12}\leq \GTenHLValue{x}<\GTenHLValue{14}$ & $\HLCumulativeProbability{17/42}$\\
$\GTenHLValue{14}\leq \GTenHLValue{x}<\GTenHLValue{18}$ & $\HLCumulativeProbability{23/42}$\\
$\GTenHLValue{18}\leq \GTenHLValue{x}<\GTenHLValue{28}$ & $\HLCumulativeProbability{47/84}$\\
$\GTenHLValue{28}\leq \GTenHLValue{x}<\GTenHLValue{30}$ & $\HLCumulativeProbability{25/28}$\\
$\GTenHLValue{x}\geq \GTenHLValue{30}$ & $\HLCumulativeProbability{1}$\\
\bottomrule\end{tabular}
\end{center}

